    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "H3 CLIP PLAN - ASSEMBLY\n\n1. Load the same song and pick the same plan in the nodes (example: robot_beach_song.mp3 and robot_beach.plan.json).\n2. Run: the saved clips are decoded in order and the original song is the soundtrack.\n\nlast_clip = 0 assembles the whole plan; another value assembles only clips 1 to N, to check the start of a video.\nThe final video is written to output/h3_clip_plan/<project>/.\n\nTAKE SELECTION (node on the right): every generation of a clip is a take. Click a take to play its preview, 'use this take' to choose it. The choice is saved in the project (selection.json) and is used by the assembly and by the following 'continue' clips. Choosing a take of a 'continue' clip also chooses the take of the previous clip it is built on. 'delete unchosen takes' cleans up."
   ],
